$ graphify install --project --platform amp
  references       ->  .agents/skills/graphify/references
  skill installed  ->  .agents/skills/graphify/SKILL.md
graphify section written to <FIXTURE_ROOT>/project/AGENTS.md

Amp will now check the knowledge graph before answering
codebase questions and rebuild it after code changes.

Note: unlike Claude Code, there is no PreToolUse hook equivalent for
Amp — the AGENTS.md rules are the always-on mechanism.

Project-scoped install. Add to version control:
  git add .agents/ AGENTS.md

$ graphify amp install
  references       ->  <FIXTURE_ROOT>/home/.config/agents/skills/graphify/references
  skill installed  ->  <FIXTURE_ROOT>/home/.config/agents/skills/graphify/SKILL.md
graphify already configured in <FIXTURE_ROOT>/project/AGENTS.md (no change)

Amp will now check the knowledge graph before answering
codebase questions and rebuild it after code changes.

Note: unlike Claude Code, there is no PreToolUse hook equivalent for
Amp — the AGENTS.md rules are the always-on mechanism.
